How it was tested: User was asked to:

Find NCAA Division I standings.
View NCAA news.
Change a league preference.
Return to the homepage.

What happened:

User successfully located standings and news.
User initially struggled to find the Preferences page.
User thought some of the pages and buttons were repetitive. 
User loves volleyball and wanted to get some real data in there instead of all sample data. 

Severity: Low

Action: Navigation labels were moved around. NCAA D1 real data was integrated. 

